@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Agent
participant "Angular App" as UI
participant "Ocelot Gateway" as GW
participant "QuoteRatingService" as QR
participant "CustomerVehicleService" as CV
participant "ClaimsService" as CL
participant "UnderwritingService" as UW
participant "UnderwritingDb" as UDb

Agent -> UI : Select assigned customer + vehicle
UI -> GW : POST /quotes/api/customers/{customerId}/quotes
GW -> QR : Start/resume Draft quote
QR -> CV : GET /internal/customer-risk/{customerId}/vehicles/{vehicleId}
CV --> QR : Risk/readiness context
QR -> CL : GET /internal/claims/history
CL --> QR : Qualifying prior-3-year claim count
QR --> GW : Draft / comparison context
GW --> UI : Basic / Standard / Premium

Agent -> UI : Configure plan / limits / deductibles / add-ons
UI -> GW : PUT /quotes/api/quotes/{quoteId}/configuration
GW -> QR : Save configuration
QR --> GW : Updated draft
GW --> UI : Updated draft

Agent -> UI : Recalculate + finalize
UI -> GW : POST /quotes/api/quotes/{quoteId}/recalculate
GW -> QR : Recalculate current risk + pricing
QR --> GW : Authoritative draft premium
GW --> UI : Premium
UI -> GW : POST /quotes/api/quotes/{quoteId}/finalize
GW -> QR : Freshness check + immutable snapshot
QR --> GW : Finalized quote
GW --> UI : Finalized quote / 7-day validity

Agent -> UI : Submit quote
UI -> GW : POST /quotes/api/quotes/{quoteId}/submit
GW -> QR : Submit quote
QR -> UW : POST /internal/underwriting/applications
UW -> UDb : Create/return application by unique OriginatingQuoteId
UDb --> UW : ApplicationId + status
UW --> QR : ApplicationId + status
QR --> GW : Submission confirmed
GW --> UI : Underwriting application created
@enduml
